# Environment Variable Rules (full doc: docs/environment.md)

When adding or modifying environment variables, update **two places** in `src/libs/env/env.ts`:

1. Add to `envSchema` — Zod schema with proper validation
2. Add to `parseEnv()` — pass the variable to `safeParse()`

## Checklist

- [ ] Added to `envSchema` with Zod validation
- [ ] Added to `parseEnv()` safeParse object
- [ ] Added to `.env.example` with documentation
- [ ] Added to `.env` (local development)

For full variable reference and usage patterns: read docs/environment.md
